Z||000000||Cliff Pennock||07-03-2001||06:13 AM||||1) I will not try to explain why I closed those threads. If you don't have a clue, then you don't have a brain.<P>2) Don't ever give me that "freedom of speech" crap again as an excuse to insult others or to post general crap. If you joined the forum, you have agreed with the "Rules, Policies, and Disclaimers". In short, I can delete any post if I want to.<P>3) Don't <B>ever</B> make threats like "you can ban me, but I'll be back, you can never ban me". Let me enlighten you. <B>Yes I can.</B> Don't think I'm a half-assed webmaster that has no clue what he's doing.<P>4) Don't <B>ever</B> make threats like "if you ban me, I'll sue". Wanna sue me? Fine. I have a bunch of lawyers that will eat you alive.<P>5) Right now, I have <B>zero</B> tolerance about what is being posted in <B>any</B> section. Don't like it? See if I care.<P>6) Crap happened in the chat? Leave it there. Don't take it into the forum.<P>7) Have a problem with another forum member's post? Ignore him/her. Don't post any replies. Send me an email. I'll delete the offending topic. Things <B>do</B> go away if you ignore it.<P>In short, this crap is starting to piss me off tremendously. It's unbelievable how little respect some people have for a FREE service like this. It's unbelievable why just a handful of people find it necessary to destroy something that's being enjoyed by thousands of others. If you think you have a <B>right</B> to post here, think again.<BR>||||reg||1
