Z||000007||fiero56||07-03-2001||09:45 AM||||I rarely ever check this forum anymore because of all the useless crap flying around. I was e-mailed this thread link and have no idea what threads this is about, I haven't looked for them. I am actually kinda' surprised you still keep paying to keep the forum "up-and-flying" Cliff. Seems most of the people with tech expertise are gone('cept for Ogre, and even he said he was done posting answers), and every question I see is covered many times in the archives.<P>Anyone else remember back when we had 500 members, and most, if not all, had some sort of itelligence, and knew how to get their porn, rather than go searching in the Pontiac Fiero lists. I'll say what I bet many are thinking, It was better back in '99 with only a few hundred members who knew their stuff, rather than 2000 members, where the same 20 keep answering the same question on a daily basis.<P>Shut it down Cliff, but before you do, I want a complete CD of all the archives up to that point. The archives are the best going thing for PFF.||||reg||1
Z||000008||Slammed Fiero||07-03-2001||09:46 AM||||I appologize if I caused any crap , I was just defending myself..<P><BR>JM ||||reg||1
Z||000009||stimpy||07-03-2001||10:42 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fiero56:<BR><B>Shut it down Cliff, but before you do, I want a complete CD of all the archives up to that point. The archives are the best going thing for PFF.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>My gut reaction is to say that we NEED to keep PFF alive and kicking, but lately we're seeing a lot of evidence to the contrary. It seems we're getting a lot of threads about carnal relations and pissing matches.  I remember when Monkeyman got jumped all over when he started a tabacco related thread. It seems perfectly quaint now. Any day I expect to see a thread started about setting up ones own meth lab.<P>Maybe it is time to hang it up. I'd hate to see it happen, and I'd surely get ill from withdrawals, but even more would I hate to see this forum slip even more into the slime.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000010||fierobaby||07-03-2001||10:43 AM||||I am with slammed on apoligizing... I'm sorry Cliff! I know I started it I love you though!!!!  I SORRY I SOOOO SORRY!!! MWAH!||||reg||1
